Package: attitudedyn
Title: The Nepaul-Stern Model of Attitude Stability and Constraint
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriel", "Mihalache", email = "mihalache@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Gabriel Mihalache [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Gabriel Mihalache <mihalache@gmail.com>
Description: Estimates The Nepaul-Stern Model of Attitude Stability and
    Constraint for several Likert-scale attitudes measured on the same
    people across survey waves. The likelihood is a
    Geweke-Hajivassiliou-Keane simulated likelihood. The latent attitude
    carries forward from one wave to the next.
